    "The 2.35 commodity and MagicMenuPrefs match the Aminet release. The installed English guide is the 2.30 guide from MagicMenu_II.lha.",
    "The checked BCWB payload supplies the WBStartup icon, preferences icon and saved ENVARC settings. The startup icon sets STARTPRI=60, DONOTWAIT and CX_POPUP=NO. The saved settings enable MagicMenu and bind its keyboard menu to Right Amiga+Space.",
